        <param>
          <type>const arma::fmat &amp;</type>
          <declname>mat</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Converts an Armadillo floating-point matrix (arma::fmat) to a standard C++ 2D vector. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>This function iterates over the elements of the arma::fmat and copies them into a std::vector&lt;std::vector&lt;float&gt;&gt; of the same dimensions.</para>
